Skyfury Aura Loop
    Events
        Time - Every 0.25 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- Reset the Max Increase of units affected by Aura: --------
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in SF_TargetGroup and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Set VariableSet SF_Target = (Picked unit)
                Set VariableSet SF_CV = (Custom value of SF_Target)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        ((Picked unit) has buff Skyfury (Level 1)) Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- - --------
                        -------- Remove stats --------
                        Set VariableSet Stats_Crit[SF_CV] = (Stats_Crit[SF_CV] - SF_Setup_Crit)
                        Set VariableSet Stats_SpellPowerPct[SF_CV] = (Stats_SpellPowerPct[SF_CV] - SF_Setup_Spell)
                        -------- - --------
                        Unit Group - Remove SF_Target from SF_TargetGroup.
                        Set VariableSet SF_IsInTargetGroup[SF_CV] = False
                    Else - Actions
        -------- ---------------- --------
        -------- Loop over all of the unit's with Aura and increase the XXX of allies near them: --------
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in SF_SourceGroup and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Set VariableSet SF_Source = (Picked unit)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (SF_Source is alive) Equal to True
                        (Level of SF_Setup_Aura for SF_Source) Greater than 0
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet SF_Point = (Position of SF_Source)
                        -------- - --------
                        Custom script:   set bj_wantDestroyGroup = true
                        Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units within SF_Setup_AoE of SF_Point.) and do (Actions)
                            Loop - Actions
                                Set VariableSet SF_Target = (Picked unit)
                                Set VariableSet SF_CV = (Custom value of SF_Target)
                                -------- - --------
                                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                                    If - Conditions
                                        (SF_Target is alive) Equal to True
                                        (SF_Target belongs to an ally of (Owner of SF_Source).) Equal to True
                                        (SF_Target is A structure) Equal to False
                                    Then - Actions
                                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                                            If - Conditions
                                                SF_IsInTargetGroup[SF_CV] Equal to False
                                            Then - Actions
                                                -------- Increase stats --------
                                                Set VariableSet Stats_Crit[SF_CV] = (Stats_Crit[SF_CV] + SF_Setup_Crit)
                                                Set VariableSet Stats_SpellPowerPct[SF_CV] = (Stats_SpellPowerPct[SF_CV] + SF_Setup_Spell)
                                                -------- - --------
                                                Unit Group - Add SF_Target to SF_TargetGroup
                                                Set VariableSet SF_IsInTargetGroup[SF_CV] = True
                                            Else - Actions
                                    Else - Actions
                        --------   --------
                        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation (udg_SF_Point)
                    Else - Actions
                        --------  The Aura source is dead or lost the ability so they shouldn't be emitting an Aura anymore:  --------
                        Unit Group - Remove SF_Source from SF_SourceGroup.
                        Set VariableSet SF_SourceCount = (SF_SourceCount - 1)
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                SF_SourceCount Equal to 0
                            Then - Actions
                                Trigger - Turn off Skyfury Aura Loop <gen>
                            Else - Actions
